# ruleset.txt - which fair-play ruleset the 1.6.6+ clients must enforce on this server.
# Copy to ruleset.txt next to cod_lnxded (or point COD1RELOADED_RULESET_FILE at it).
# Re-read live every second. The rules themselves live in https://github.com/cod1plus/rulesets
# (one <id>.pb per id); clients download them at launch, so nothing else to install here.
#   <id>            name the list (default when this file is absent: codbase-2023-05)
#   <id>@<version>  same, and clients behind that version re-download it IN GAME
#                   (edit the .pb online, bump its "; version N" header, write "<id>@N" here)
#   0               no ruleset (fun / aim-trainer server; competitive.cfg still applies)
codbase-2023-05
